    <briefdescription>
<para>Extended Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes the Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process governed by <formula id="135">\[ dx = a (b(t) - x_t) dt + \sigma dW_t. \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
